  "description": "A bright, fully furnished one-bedroom apartment on Barrack Street, Ballaghaderreen, a short walk from the town's shops and services.\n\nThe open-plan kitchen, living and dining area has tiled floors, a skylight over the kitchen, cream shaker-style units, an electric cooker, a fridge-freezer, a washing machine and a microwave, with a sofa, coffee table and dining set. The double bedroom has a double bed, a double wardrobe and bedside lockers. There is a modern shower room with a corner shower. Electric heating, with parking.\n\nThe tenant pays electricity, heating and refuse charges in addition to the rent. The deposit is one month's rent.\n\nThis is a long-term tenancy registered with the RTB. Under the Residential Tenancies Acts, a tenancy becomes a 6-year tenancy once the first 6 months are complete. All applications are welcome.\n\nHOW TO APPLY\nPlease email us using the contact button on this ad, with:\n- the full names of everyone who will live in the apartment\n- a contact phone number\n- your preferred move-in date\n- contact details for two of your current or most recent landlords, for a reference\n\nWe will contact shortlisted applicants to arrange viewings. Before the tenancy agreement is signed, the successful applicant will be asked for photo ID and references. We use your personal data only to assess your application. If your application is unsuccessful, we delete it.",
